  "description": "A high-performance mediator implementation for .NET 9+ with built-in support for background processing, persistent notifications, and deadlock-safe ConfigureAwait behavior by default. Modern alternative to MediatR with advanced features like compiled expressions, aggressive performance optimizations, automatic UI deadlock prevention, and crash-safe persistence. Supports .NET 9 and .NET 10.",
